#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Gate Cutting to Reduce Circuit Depth"
msgstr "Gate Cutting untuk Mengurangkan Kedalaman Circuit"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/02_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_depth.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/02_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_depth.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this tutorial, we will reduce a circuit's depth by cutting distant gates, avoiding the swap gates that would otherwise be introduced by routing.\n"
msgstr "Dalam tutorial ini, kita akan mengurangkan kedalaman Circuit dengan memotong gate yang berjauhan, mengelakkan swap gates yang akan diperkenalkan semasa routing.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These are the steps that we will take in this [Qiskit pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns):\n"
msgstr "Berikut adalah langkah-langkah yang akan kita ambil dalam [corak Qiskit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) ini:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1: Map problem to quantum circuits and operators**:\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 1: Peta masalah kepada Circuit dan operator kuantum**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map the hamiltonian onto a quantum circuit.\n"
msgstr "Petakan hamiltonian ke dalam Circuit kuantum.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 2: Optimize for target hardware** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 2: Optimumkan untuk perkakasan sasaran** [_Menggunakan cutting addon_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Cut the circuit and observable.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Potong Circuit dan observable.</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the subexperiments for hardware.\n"
msgstr "Transpile subeksperimen untuk perkakasan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 3: Execute on target hardware**:\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 3: Laksanakan pada perkakasan sasaran**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments obtained in Step 2 using a `Sampler` primitive.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan subeksperimen yang diperoleh dalam Langkah 2 menggunakan primitif `Sampler`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4: Post-process results** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 4: Proses pasca keputusan** [_Menggunakan cutting addon_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Combine the results of Step 3 to reconstruct the expectation value of the observable in question.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Gabungkan keputusan Langkah 3 untuk membina semula nilai jangkaan observable yang berkenaan.</font>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map {#step-1-map}"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Peta {#step-1-map}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a circuit to run on the backend {#create-a-circuit-to-run-on-the-backend}"
msgstr "Cipta Circuit untuk dijalankan pada Backend {#create-a-circuit-to-run-on-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_1.png)\n"
msgstr "![Rajah Circuit kuantum](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_1.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify an observable {#specify-an-observable}"
msgstr "Tentukan observable {#specify-an-observable}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize {#step-2-optimize}"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Optimumkan {#step-2-optimize}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify a backend {#specify-a-backend}"
msgstr "Tentukan Backend {#specify-a-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can provide either a fake backend or a hardware backend from Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menyediakan sama ada Backend palsu atau Backend perkakasan daripada Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the circuit, visualize the swaps, and note the depth {#transpile-the-circuit-visualize-the-swaps-and-note-the-depth}"
msgstr "Transpile Circuit, visualisasikan swap, dan catat kedalaman {#transpile-the-circuit-visualize-the-swaps-and-note-the-depth}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We choose a layout that requires two swaps to execute the gates between qubits 3 and 0 and another two swaps to return the qubits to their initial positions.\n"
msgstr "Kita pilih susun atur yang memerlukan dua swap untuk melaksanakan gate antara qubit 3 dan 0, serta dua swap lagi untuk memulangkan qubit ke kedudukan asal mereka.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_2.png)\n"
msgstr "![Rajah Circuit kuantum](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_2.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replace distant gates with `TwoQubitQPDGate`s by specifying their indices {#replace-distant-gates-with-twoqubitqpdgates-by-specifying-their-indices}"
msgstr "Gantikan gate yang berjauhan dengan `TwoQubitQPDGate` dengan menentukan indeksnya {#replace-distant-gates-with-twoqubitqpdgates-by-specifying-their-indices}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`cut_gates` will replace the gates in the specified indices with `TwoQubitQPDGate`s and also return a list of `QPDBasis` instances -- one for each gate decomposition.\n"
msgstr "`cut_gates` akan menggantikan gate pada indeks yang ditentukan dengan `TwoQubitQPDGate` dan juga mengembalikan senarai contoh `QPDBasis` — satu untuk setiap penguraian gate.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_3.png)\n"
msgstr "![Rajah Circuit kuantum](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_3.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate the subexperiments to run on the backend {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"
msgstr "Jana subeksperimen untuk dijalankan pada Backend {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`generate_cutting_experiments` accepts a circuit containing `TwoQubitQPDGate` instances and observables as a `PauliList`.\n"
msgstr "`generate_cutting_experiments` menerima Circuit yang mengandungi contoh `TwoQubitQPDGate` dan observable sebagai `PauliList`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To simulate the expectation value of the full-sized circuit, many subexperiments are generated from the decomposed gates' joint quasiprobability distribution and then executed on one or more backends. The number of samples taken from the distribution is controlled by `num_samples`, and one combined coefficient is given for each unique sample. For more information on how the coefficients are calculated, refer to the [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr "Untuk mensimulasikan nilai jangkaan Circuit bersaiz penuh, banyak subeksperimen dijana daripada taburan kuasiprobabiliti bersama gate yang didekomposkan, kemudian dilaksanakan pada satu atau lebih Backend. Bilangan sampel yang diambil daripada taburan dikawal oleh `num_samples`, dan satu pekali gabungan diberikan untuk setiap sampel unik. Untuk maklumat lanjut tentang cara pekali dikira, rujuk [bahan penerangan](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** The ``observables`` kwarg to `generate_cutting_experiments` is of type `PauliList`. Observable term coefficients and phases are ignored during decomposition of the problem and execution of the subexperiments. They may be re-applied during reconstruction of the expectation value.\n"
msgstr "**Nota:** Argumen `observables` kwarg kepada `generate_cutting_experiments` adalah jenis `PauliList`. Pekali dan fasa terma observable diabaikan semasa penguraian masalah dan pelaksanaan subeksperimen. Ia boleh digunakan semula semasa pembinaan semula nilai jangkaan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Calculate the sampling overhead for the chosen cuts {#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"
msgstr "Kira overhed pensampelan untuk potongan yang dipilih {#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we cut three CNOT gates, resulting in a sampling overhead of $9^3$.\n"
msgstr "Di sini kita memotong tiga gate CNOT, menghasilkan overhed pensampelan sebesar $9^3$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more on the sampling overhead incurred by circuit cutting, refer to the [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr "Untuk maklumat lanjut tentang overhed pensampelan yang ditanggung oleh circuit cutting, rujuk [bahan penerangan](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Demonstrate that the QPD subexperiments will be shallower after cutting distant gates {#demonstrate-that-the-qpd-subexperiments-will-be-shallower-after-cutting-distant-gates}"
msgstr "Tunjukkan bahawa subeksperimen QPD akan lebih cetek selepas memotong gate yang berjauhan {#demonstrate-that-the-qpd-subexperiments-will-be-shallower-after-cutting-distant-gates}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here is an example of an arbitrarily chosen subexperiment generated from the QPD circuit. Its depth has been reduced by more than half. Many of these probabilistic subexperiments must be generated and evaluated in order to reconstruct an expectation value of the deeper circuit.\n"
msgstr "Berikut adalah contoh subeksperimen yang dipilih secara rawak yang dijana daripada Circuit QPD. Kedalamannya telah dikurangkan lebih daripada separuh. Banyak subeksperimen probabilistik ini perlu dijana dan dinilai untuk membina semula nilai jangkaan Circuit yang lebih dalam.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_4.png)\n"
msgstr "![Rajah Circuit kuantum](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/02-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-depth/output_4.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare subexperiments for the backend {#prepare-subexperiments-for-the-backend}"
msgstr "Sediakan subeksperimen untuk Backend {#prepare-subexperiments-for-the-backend}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute {#step-3-execute}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Laksanakan {#step-3-execute}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments using the Qiskit Runtime Sampler primitive {#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"
msgstr "Jalankan subeksperimen menggunakan primitif Qiskit Runtime Sampler {#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process {#step-4-post-process}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Proses Pasca {#step-4-post-process}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct the expectation value {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"
msgstr "Bina semula nilai jangkaan {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct expectation values for each observable term and combine them to reconstruct the expectation value for the original observable.\n"
msgstr "Bina semula nilai jangkaan untuk setiap terma observable dan gabungkannya untuk membina semula nilai jangkaan bagi observable asal.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare the reconstructed expectation value with the exact expectation value from the original circuit and observable {#compare-the-reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-circuit-and-observable}"
msgstr "Bandingkan nilai jangkaan yang dibina semula dengan nilai jangkaan tepat daripada Circuit dan observable asal {#compare-the-reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-circuit-and-observable}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<TutorialFeedback />\n"
msgstr "<TutorialFeedback />\n"
